.5 V (3.0 V typ). I²C/INT pull-ups 1.62-3.5 V, up to 1 MHz, default address 0x41, I3C-tolerant.","141 mW average (about 47 mA at 3 V) in default 3x3 mode at 30 Hz; 57 mA while the VCSEL is ranging; 2 µA with EN low. Operating range -40 to 85 °C."],"sources":["https://look.ams-osram.com/m/52236c476132a095/original/TMF8820-21-28-Multizone-Time-of-Flight-Sensor.pdf","https://ams-osram.com/products/sensor-solutions/direct-time-of-flight-sensors-dtof/ams-tmf8821-configurable-4x4-multi-zone-time-of-flight-sensor","https://jlcpcb.com/partdetail/AMS-TMF88211AM/C17253284","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C17253284.html","https://www.digikey.com/en/products/detail/ams-osram-usa-inc/TMF8821-1AM/16285681"],"category":"ranging","specs":{"kind":"multizone","rangeMinM":0.01,"rangeMaxM":5,"fovHDeg":41,"fovVDeg":52,"zones":18,"rateHz":15,"accuracy":"±3% (>=333 mm); ±10-19 mm below","interfaces":["i2c"],"supplyV":{"min":2.7,"max":3.5},"currentMa":47,"wavelengthNm":940,"eyeSafety":"Class 1 (IEC/EN 60825-1:2014)","ambientKlux":10},"summary":"0.01–5 m, 41°, 18 zones, 15 Hz, I2C","mcuNeeds":{"device":"tof-multizone","name":"Multizone ToF (8×8)","needs":"2× GPIO, an I²C bus"},"findMcuUrl":"https://apr0t0.github.io/microchooser/?devices=tof-multizone","url":"https://apr0t0.github.io/microchooser/#/component/tmf8821"}